\pard\plain \s40\li0\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid 00001 {\cf20 // dear imgui: Platform Backend for GLFW}\par
00002 {\cf20 // This needs to be used along with a Renderer (e.g. OpenGL3, Vulkan, WebGPU..)}\par
00003 {\cf20 // (Info: GLFW is a cross-platform general purpose library for handling windows, inputs, OpenGL/Vulkan graphics context creation, etc.)}\par
00004 {\cf20 // (Requires: GLFW 3.1+. Prefer GLFW 3.3+ or GLFW 3.4+ for full feature support.)}\par
00005 \par
00006 {\cf20 // Implemented features:}\par
00007 {\cf20 //  [X] Platform: Clipboard support.}\par
00008 {\cf20 //  [X] Platform: Mouse support. Can discriminate Mouse/TouchScreen/Pen (Windows only).}\par
00009 {\cf20 //  [X] Platform: Keyboard support. Since 1.87 we are using the io.AddKeyEvent() function. Pass ImGuiKey values to all key functions e.g. ImGui::IsKeyPressed(ImGuiKey_Space). [Legacy GLFW_KEY_* values will also be supported unless IMGUI_DISABLE_OBSOLETE_KEYIO is set]}\par
00010 {\cf20 //  [X] Platform: Gamepad support. Enable with 'io.ConfigFlags |= ImGuiConfigFlags_NavEnableGamepad'.}\par
00011 {\cf20 //  [X] Platform: Mouse cursor shape and visibility. Disable with 'io.ConfigFlags |= ImGuiConfigFlags_NoMouseCursorChange' (note: the resizing cursors requires GLFW 3.4+).}\par
00012 {\cf20 //  [X] Platform: Multi-viewport support (multiple windows). Enable with 'io.ConfigFlags |= ImGuiConfigFlags_ViewportsEnable'.}\par
00013 {\cf20 // Issues:}\par
00014 {\cf20 //  [ ] Platform: Multi-viewport: ParentViewportID not honored, and so io.ConfigViewportsNoDefaultParent has no effect (minor).}\par
00015 \par
00016 {\cf20 // You can use unmodified imgui_impl_* files in your project. See examples/ folder for examples of using this.}\par
00017 {\cf20 // Prefer including the entire imgui/ repository into your project (either as a copy or as a submodule), and only build the backends you need.}\par
00018 {\cf20 // Learn about Dear ImGui:}\par
00019 {\cf20 // - FAQ                  https://dearimgui.com/faq}\par
00020 {\cf20 // - Getting Started      https://dearimgui.com/getting-started}\par
00021 {\cf20 // - Documentation        https://dearimgui.com/docs (same as your local docs/ folder).}\par
00022 {\cf20 // - Introduction, links and more at the top of imgui.cpp}\par
00023 \par
00024 {\cf20 // CHANGELOG}\par
00025 {\cf20 // (minor and older changes stripped away, please see git history for details)}\par
00026 {\cf20 //  2024-XX-XX: Platform: Added support for multiple windows via the ImGuiPlatformIO interface.}\par
00027 {\cf20 //  2024-07-31: Added ImGui_ImplGlfw_Sleep() helper function for usage by our examples app, since GLFW doesn't provide one.}\par
00028 {\cf20 //  2024-07-08: *BREAKING* Renamed ImGui_ImplGlfw_InstallEmscriptenCanvasResizeCallback to ImGui_ImplGlfw_InstallEmscriptenCallbacks(), added GLFWWindow* parameter.}\par
00029 {\cf20 //  2024-07-08: Emscripten: Added support for GLFW3 contrib port (GLFW 3.4.0 features + bug fixes): to enable, replace -sUSE_GLFW=3 with --use-port=contrib.glfw3 (requires emscripten 3.1.59+) (https://github.com/pongasoft/emscripten-glfw)}\par
00030 {\cf20 //  2024-07-02: Emscripten: Added io.PlatformOpenInShellFn() handler for Emscripten versions.}\par
00031 {\cf20 //  2023-12-19: Emscripten: Added ImGui_ImplGlfw_InstallEmscriptenCanvasResizeCallback() to register canvas selector and auto-resize GLFW window.}\par
00032 {\cf20 //  2023-10-05: Inputs: Added support for extra ImGuiKey values: F13 to F24 function keys.}\par
00033 {\cf20 //  2023-07-18: Inputs: Revert ignoring mouse data on GLFW_CURSOR_DISABLED as it can be used differently. User may set ImGuiConfigFLags_NoMouse if desired. (#5625, #6609)}\par
00034 {\cf20 //  2023-06-12: Accept glfwGetTime() not returning a monotonically increasing value. This seems to happens on some Windows setup when peripherals disconnect, and is likely to also happen on browser + Emscripten. (#6491)}\par
00035 {\cf20 //  2023-04-04: Inputs: Added support for io.AddMouseSourceEvent() to discriminate ImGuiMouseSource_Mouse/ImGuiMouseSource_TouchScreen/ImGuiMouseSource_Pen on Windows ONLY, using a custom WndProc hook. (#2702)}\par
00036 {\cf20 //  2023-03-16: Inputs: Fixed key modifiers handling on secondary viewports (docking branch). Broken on 2023/01/04. (#6248, #6034)}\par
00037 {\cf20 //  2023-03-14: Emscripten: Avoid using glfwGetError() and glfwGetGamepadState() which are not correctly implemented in Emscripten emulation. (#6240)}\par
00038 {\cf20 //  2023-02-03: Emscripten: Registering custom low-level mouse wheel handler to get more accurate scrolling impulses on Emscripten. (#4019, #6096)}\par
00039 {\cf20 //  2023-01-18: Handle unsupported glfwGetVideoMode() call on e.g. Emscripten.}\par
00040 {\cf20 //  2023-01-04: Inputs: Fixed mods state on Linux when using Alt-GR text input (e.g. German keyboard layout), could lead to broken text input. Revert a 2022/01/17 change were we resumed using mods provided by GLFW, turns out they were faulty.}\par
00041 {\cf20 //  2022-11-22: Perform a dummy glfwGetError() read to cancel missing names with glfwGetKeyName(). (#5908)}\par
00042 {\cf20 //  2022-10-18: Perform a dummy glfwGetError() read to cancel missing mouse cursors errors. Using GLFW_VERSION_COMBINED directly. (#5785)}\par
00043 {\cf20 //  2022-10-11: Using 'nullptr' instead of 'NULL' as per our switch to C++11.}\par
00044 {\cf20 //  2022-09-26: Inputs: Renamed ImGuiKey_ModXXX introduced in 1.87 to ImGuiMod_XXX (old names still supported).}\par
00045 {\cf20 //  2022-09-01: Inputs: Honor GLFW_CURSOR_DISABLED by not setting mouse position *EDIT* Reverted 2023-07-18.}\par
00046 {\cf20 //  2022-04-30: Inputs: Fixed ImGui_ImplGlfw_TranslateUntranslatedKey() for lower case letters on OSX.}\par
00047 {\cf20 //  2022-03-23: Inputs: Fixed a regression in 1.87 which resulted in keyboard modifiers events being reported incorrectly on Linux/X11.}\par
00048 {\cf20 //  2022-02-07: Added ImGui_ImplGlfw_InstallCallbacks()/ImGui_ImplGlfw_RestoreCallbacks() helpers to facilitate user installing callbacks after initializing backend.}\par
00049 {\cf20 //  2022-01-26: Inputs: replaced short-lived io.AddKeyModsEvent() (added two weeks ago) with io.AddKeyEvent() using ImGuiKey_ModXXX flags. Sorry for the confusion.}\par
00050 {\cf20 //  2021-01-20: Inputs: calling new io.AddKeyAnalogEvent() for gamepad support, instead of writing directly to io.NavInputs[].}\par
00051 {\cf20 //  2022-01-17: Inputs: calling new io.AddMousePosEvent(), io.AddMouseButtonEvent(), io.AddMouseWheelEvent() API (1.87+).}\par
00052 {\cf20 //  2022-01-17: Inputs: always update key mods next and before key event (not in NewFrame) to fix input queue with very low framerates.}\par
00053 {\cf20 //  2022-01-12: *BREAKING CHANGE*: Now using glfwSetCursorPosCallback(). If you called ImGui_ImplGlfw_InitXXX() with install_callbacks = false, you MUST install glfwSetCursorPosCallback() and forward it to the backend via ImGui_ImplGlfw_CursorPosCallback().}\par
00054 {\cf20 //  2022-01-10: Inputs: calling new io.AddKeyEvent(), io.AddKeyModsEvent() + io.SetKeyEventNativeData() API (1.87+). Support for full ImGuiKey range.}\par
00055 {\cf20 //  2022-01-05: Inputs: Converting GLFW untranslated keycodes back to translated keycodes (in the ImGui_ImplGlfw_KeyCallback() function) in order to match the behavior of every other backend, and facilitate the use of GLFW with lettered-shortcuts API.}\par
00056 {\cf20 //  2021-08-17: *BREAKING CHANGE*: Now using glfwSetWindowFocusCallback() to calling io.AddFocusEvent(). If you called ImGui_ImplGlfw_InitXXX() with install_callbacks = false, you MUST install glfwSetWindowFocusCallback() and forward it to the backend via ImGui_ImplGlfw_WindowFocusCallback().}\par
00057 {\cf20 //  2021-07-29: *BREAKING CHANGE*: Now using glfwSetCursorEnterCallback(). MousePos is correctly reported when the host platform window is hovered but not focused. If you called ImGui_ImplGlfw_InitXXX() with install_callbacks = false, you MUST install glfwSetWindowFocusCallback() callback and forward it to the backend via ImGui_ImplGlfw_CursorEnterCallback().}\par
00058 {\cf20 //  2021-06-29: Reorganized backend to pull data from a single structure to facilitate usage with multiple-contexts (all g_XXXX access changed to bd->XXXX).}\par
00059 {\cf20 //  2020-01-17: Inputs: Disable error callback while assigning mouse cursors because some X11 setup don't have them and it generates errors.}\par
00060 {\cf20 //  2019-12-05: Inputs: Added support for new mouse cursors added in GLFW 3.4+ (resizing cursors, not allowed cursor).}\par
