00065 {\cf20 //  2018-11-30: Misc: Setting up io.BackendPlatformName so it can be displayed in the About Window.}\par
00066 {\cf20 //  2018-11-07: Inputs: When installing our GLFW callbacks, we save user's previously installed ones - if any - and chain call them.}\par
00067 {\cf20 //  2018-08-01: Inputs: Workaround for Emscripten which doesn't seem to handle focus related calls.}\par
00068 {\cf20 //  2018-06-29: Inputs: Added support for the ImGuiMouseCursor_Hand cursor.}\par
