01038 {\cf20 // GLFW may dispatch window pos/size events after calling glfwSetWindowPos()/glfwSetWindowSize().}\par
01039 {\cf20 // However: depending on the platform the callback may be invoked at different time:}\par
01040 {\cf20 // - on Windows it appears to be called within the glfwSetWindowPos()/glfwSetWindowSize() call}\par
01041 {\cf20 // - on Linux it is queued and invoked during glfwPollEvents()}\par
01042 {\cf20 // Because the event doesn't always fire on glfwSetWindowXXX() we use a frame counter tag to only}\par
01043 {\cf20 // ignore recent glfwSetWindowXXX() calls.}\par
